Subject: [PATCH 2/2] [IR] Add `samesign` flag to icmp instruction (#111419)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Inspired by
﻿https://discourse.llvm.org/t/rfc-signedness-independent-icmps/81423
